<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vibe Coding Framework | Config-Driven Prompt Orchestration</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700&family=DM+Serif+Display&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f1419;
      --bg-card: #1a1f26;
      --bg-card-hover: #242b35;
      --text-primary: #e7e9ea;
      --text-secondary: #8b98a5;
      --text-muted: #6e7a86;
      --accent-blue: #1d9bf0;
      --accent-purple: #7856ff;
      --accent-green: #00ba7c;
      --accent-yellow: #ffd000;
      --accent-red: #f4212e;
      --accent-orange: #ff7a00;
      --border-subtle: #2f3336;
      --gradient-1: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d9bf0 0%, #7856ff 100%);
      --gradient-2: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ba7c 0%, #1d9bf0 100%);
      --gradient-3: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7a00 0%, #ffd000 100%);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(29, 155, 240, 0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .header .tagline {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .header .analogy {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: inline-block;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-yellow);
    }

    .header .analogy p {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Navigation */
    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 50px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .nav-btn.active {
      background: var(--accent-blue);
      border-color: var(--accent-blue);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Main Content */
    .main {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    /* Section */
    .section {
      display: none;
    }

    .section.active {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Overview Section */
    .overview-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .overview-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .overview-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-blue);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .overview-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .overview-card p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Three Layers */
    .layers-section {
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .layers-section h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .layers-diagram {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .layer-box {
      width: 200px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 2px solid;
    }

    .layer-box.ux {
      background: rgba(120, 86, 255, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--accent-purple);
    }

    .layer-box.api {
      background: rgba(0, 186, 124, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--accent-green);
    }

    .layer-box.schema {
      background: rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--accent-orange);
    }

    .layer-box h4 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .layer-box p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .layer-box .icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    /* Config Cards */
    .config-selector {
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .config-selector h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .config-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .config-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .config-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
    }

    .config-card.crud::before { background: var(--gradient-1); }
    .config-card.dashboard::before { background: var(--gradient-2); }
    .config-card.api::before { background: var(--gradient-3); }

    .config-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-blue);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .config-card .icon {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .config-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .config-card p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .config-card .layers-indicator {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .layer-badge {
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .layer-badge.primary {
      background: rgba(29, 155, 240, 0.2);
      color: var(--accent-blue);
    }

    .layer-badge.secondary {
      background: rgba(139, 152, 165, 0.2);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* Config Detail View */
    .config-detail {
      display: none;
    }

    .config-detail.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .config-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .back-btn {
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .back-btn:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .config-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    /* Phase Flow */
    .phase-flow {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .phase-item {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .phase-header {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .phase-header:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    }

    .phase-number {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .phase-number.blue { background: var(--accent-blue); }
    .phase-number.purple { background: var(--accent-purple); }
    .phase-number.yellow { background: var(--accent-yellow); color: #000; }
    .phase-number.green { background: var(--accent-green); }
    .phase-number.red { background: var(--accent-red); }
    .phase-number.orange { background: var(--accent-orange); }

    .phase-info {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .phase-info h4 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .phase-info p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .phase-toggle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .phase-item.expanded .phase-toggle {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }

    .phase-content {
      display: none;
      padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .phase-item.expanded .phase-content {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Questions */
    .questions-list {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .question-item {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
    }

    .question-item .q-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .question-item .q-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .question-item .q-hint {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .question-item .q-type {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* Gates */
    .gates-section {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .gates-section h5 {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .gate-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .gate-check {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-green);
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--accent-green);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    /* JSON Viewer */
    .json-section {
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .json-section h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .json-toggle {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .json-toggle:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .json-viewer {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .json-viewer.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .json-tabs {
      display: flex;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .json-tab {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .json-tab:hover {
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .json-tab.active {
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      border-bottom-color: var(--accent-blue);
    }

    .json-content {
      display: none;
      padding: 1rem;
      max-height: 500px;
      overflow: auto;
    }

    .json-content.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .json-content pre {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      margin-top: 4rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .header h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .layers-diagram {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .layer-box {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 280px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="header">
    <h1>Vibe Coding Framework</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Config-driven prompt orchestration for Product Owners. Pick a pattern, answer questions, get a structured AI-ready specification.</p>
    <div class="analogy">
      <p>"Prompting AI without structure is like ordering 'the usual' at a restaurant you've never been to."</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="nav">
    <button class="nav-btn active" data-section="overview">Overview</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-section="configs">Config Patterns</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-section="json">Developer JSON</button>
  </nav>

  <main class="main">

    <!-- OVERVIEW SECTION -->
    <section id="overview" class="section active">
      <div class="overview-grid">
        <div class="overview-card">
          <h3>🎯 The Problem</h3>
          <p>Product Owners have AI tools but no structured way to use them. Unstructured prompts produce incomplete, inconsistent outputs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overview-card">
          <h3>💡 The Solution</h3>
          <p>A config-driven framework that walks non-programmers through the right questions, in the right order, for their specific app type.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overview-card">
          <h3>📦 The Product</h3>
          <p>The config file IS the product. Each config is a curated thought pattern — expert knowledge packaged for anyone to use.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="layers-section">
        <h2>The Three Layers of Any App</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Every application is some combination of these three pieces.</p>
        <div class="layers-diagram">
          <div class="layer-box ux">
            <div class="icon">🎨</div>
            <h4>UX / Wireframe</h4>
            <p>What the user sees and does</p>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-box api">
            <div class="icon">⚙️</div>
            <h4>API / Biz Logic</h4>
            <p>What happens when they do it</p>
          </div>
          <div class="layer-box schema">
            <div class="icon">🗄️</div>
            <h4>DB Schema</h4>
            <p>Where it lives and how it relates</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="config-selector">
        <h2>Choose Your Pattern</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Each pattern asks different questions based on what you're building.</p>
        <div class="config-cards">
          <div class="config-card crud" data-config="crud">
            <div class="icon">📝</div>
            <h3>CRUD Form Builder</h3>
            <p>Data entry forms with create, read, update, delete operations. Validation, workflows, submissions.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">UX Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge secondary">API Secondary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="config-card dashboard" data-config="dashboard">
            <div class="icon">📊</div>
            <h3>Analytics Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Metrics, charts, filters, drill-downs. KPI tracking and data visualization.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">UX Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge primary">API Primary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="config-card api" data-config="api">
            <div class="icon">🔌</div>
            <h3>API Integration</h3>
            <p>Connecting to external or internal APIs. Authentication, error handling, data mapping.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">API Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge primary">Schema Primary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONFIGS SECTION -->
    <section id="configs" class="section">
      
      <!-- Config List -->
      <div id="config-list">
        <h2 style="font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Select a Configuration Pattern</h2>
        <div class="config-cards">
          <div class="config-card crud" data-config="crud">
            <div class="icon">📝</div>
            <h3>CRUD Form Builder</h3>
            <p>Data entry forms with create, read, update, delete operations.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">UX Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge secondary">API/Schema Secondary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="config-card dashboard" data-config="dashboard">
            <div class="icon">📊</div>
            <h3>Analytics Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Metrics, charts, filters, drill-downs.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">UX Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge primary">API Primary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="config-card api" data-config="api">
            <div class="icon">🔌</div>
            <h3>API Integration</h3>
            <p>Connecting to external or internal APIs.</p>
            <div class="layers-indicator">
              <span class="layer-badge primary">API Primary</span>
              <span class="layer-badge primary">Schema Primary</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CRUD Detail -->
      <div id="config-crud" class="config-detail">
        <div class="config-header">
          <button class="back-btn" onclick="showConfigList()">← Back</button>
          <h2 class="config-title">📝 CRUD Form Builder</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">For data entry forms with validation, workflows, and submissions. <strong>UX-heavy</strong> — most questions focus on fields, layout, and user interaction.</p>
        
        <div class="phase-flow">
          <div class="phase-item expanded">
            <div class="phase-header" onclick="togglePhase(this)">
              <div class="phase-number blue">1</div>
              <div class="phase-info">
                <h4>Context</h4>
                <p>What form are we building and why?</p>
              </div>
              <div class="phase-toggle">▼</div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-content">
              <div class="questions-list">
                <div class="question-item">
                  <div class="q-label">Question</div>
                  <div class="q-text">What is this form for? Describe in plain language.</div>
                  <div class="q-hint">e.g., "A form for nurses to submit supply requests for their department"</div>
                  <span class="q-type">textarea • required • maps to: all layers</span>
                </div>
                <div class="question-item">
                  <div class="q-label">Question</div>
                  <div class="q-text">Do you have a screenshot or mockup of an existing/similar form?</div>
                  <span class="q-type">image • optional • maps to: UX</span>
                </div>
                <div class="question-item">
                  <div class="q-label">Question</div>
                  <div class="q-text">What technology stack?</div>
                  <div class="q-hint">Options: Vue.js/TypeScript, React/TypeScript, Angular, Other</div>
                  <span class="q-type">select • required • maps to: all layers</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="gates-section">
                <h5>🚦 Quality Gates (must pass before proceeding)</h5>
                <div class="gate-item"><div class="gate-check">✓</div> Purpose clearly defined</div>
                <div class="gate-item"><div class="gate-check">✓</div> Tech stack confirmed</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase-item">
            <div class="phase-header" onclick="togglePhase(this)">
              <div class="phase-number purple">2</div>
              <div class="phase-info">
                <h4>Form Fields</h4>
                <p>What data does the form collect?</p>
              </div>
              <div class="phase-toggle">▼</div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-content">
              <div class="questions-list">
                <div class="question-item">
                  <div class="q-label">Question</div>
                  <div class="q-text">List all fields the form needs. One per line.</div>
                  <div class="q-hint">e.g., Facility (dropdown), Department (dropdown), Item Description (text), Quantity (number)</div>
                  <span class="q-type">textarea • required • maps to: UX</span>
                </div>
                <div class="question-item">
                  <div class="q-label">Question</div>
                  <div class="q-text">Which fields are required?</div>
                  <span class="q-type">textarea • required • maps to: UX</span>
                </div>
                <div class="question-item">
